<h3 data-start=3D"3048" data-end=3D"3067" class=3D"">2.2 Explication</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3069" data-end=3D"3489">
<li data-start=3D"3069" data-end=3D"3160" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3071" data-end=3D"3160" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
071" data-end=3D"3093">Composant Parent :</strong> La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 <=
code data-start=3D"3107" data-end=3D"3122">parentMessage</code> est d=C3=A9=
finie dans la classe du parent.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3161" data-end=3D"3371" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3163" data-end=3D"3371" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
163" data-end=3D"3185">Composant Enfant :</strong> La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 <=
code data-start=3D"3199" data-end=3D"3217">@Input() message</code> dans le =
composant enfant est utilis=C3=A9e pour recevoir la valeur de <code data-st=
art=3D"3283" data-end=3D"3298">parentMessage</code>. Le binding <code data-=
start=3D"3311" data-end=3D"3338">[message]=3D"parentMessage"</code> permet =
de transmettre la donn=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3372" data-end=3D"3489" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3374" data-end=3D"3489" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
374" data-end=3D"3395">Template Enfant :</strong> Le <code data-start=3D"33=
99" data-end=3D"3408">message</code> est affich=C3=A9 dynamiquement dans le=
 template enfant gr=C3=A2ce =C3=A0 la liaison de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3491" data-end=3D"3531" class=3D"">2.3 Changement Dynamiq=
ue des Donn=C3=A9es</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3533" data-end=3D"3671" class=3D"">Si les donn=C3=A9es dan=
s le parent changent, la vue de l=E2=80=99enfant est automatiquement mise =
=C3=A0 jour, car Angular g=C3=A8re la d=C3=A9tection des changements.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3673" data-end=3D"3676" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3678" data-end=3D"3761" class=3D"">Partie 3 : <code data-=
start=3D"3692" data-end=3D"3701">@Output</code> =E2=80=93 =C3=89mettre des =
=C3=89v=C3=A9nements du Composant Enfant vers le Parent</h2>
<p data-start=3D"3763" data-end=3D"3965" class=3D"">Le d=C3=A9corateur <cod=
e data-start=3D"3777" data-end=3D"3786">@Output</code> permet =C3=A0 un com=
posant enfant d'=C3=A9mettre des =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements que le parent peut =
=C3=A9couter. C=E2=80=99est utile lorsque l=E2=80=99enfant doit notifier le=
 parent de certaines actions ou changements d=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3967" data-end=3D"3995" class=3D"">3.1 Syntaxe de <code d=
ata-start=3D"3986" data-end=3D"3995">@Output</code></h3>
