<h3 data-start=3D"5323" data-end=3D"5342" class=3D"">3.2 Explication</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5344" data-end=3D"5834">
<li data-start=3D"5344" data-end=3D"5545" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5346" data-end=3D"5545" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
346" data-end=3D"5368">Composant Enfant :</strong> Lorsqu'un utilisateur cl=
ique sur le bouton, la m=C3=A9thode <code data-start=3D"5424" data-end=3D"5=
439">sendMessage()</code> est appel=C3=A9e, et l'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement <code =
data-start=3D"5468" data-end=3D"5476">notify</code> est =C3=A9mis avec la m=
=C3=A9thode <code data-start=3D"5502" data-end=3D"5510">emit()</code>. Cela=
 envoie un message au parent.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5546" data-end=3D"5754" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5548" data-end=3D"5754" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
548" data-end=3D"5570">Composant Parent :</strong> Le parent =C3=A9coute l'=
=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement avec <code data-start=3D"5605" data-end=3D"5643">(notif=
y)=3D"onMessageReceived($event)"</code>. Lorsque l'=C3=A9v=C3=A9nement est =
=C3=A9mis, la m=C3=A9thode <code data-start=3D"5686" data-end=3D"5707">onMe=
ssageReceived()</code> est appel=C3=A9e et re=C3=A7oit le message via <code=
 data-start=3D"5745" data-end=3D"5753">$event</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5755" data-end=3D"5834" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5757" data-end=3D"5834" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
757" data-end=3D"5778">Template Parent :</strong> Le message re=C3=A7u est =
affich=C3=A9 dans le template du parent.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5836" data-end=3D"5839" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5841" data-end=3D"5905" class=3D"">Partie 4 : Cas d'Utili=
sation Avanc=C3=A9s de <code data-start=3D"5884" data-end=3D"5892">@Input</=
