<h3 data-start=3D"3573" data-end=3D"3592" class=3D"">2.3 Explication</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3593" data-end=3D"3909">
<li data-start=3D"3593" data-end=3D"3787" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3595" data-end=3D"3787" class=3D"">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 =
<code data-start=3D"3608" data-end=3D"3619">isVisible</code> est utilis=C3=
=A9e pour contr=C3=B4ler la visibilit=C3=A9 du <code data-start=3D"3665" da=
