</li>
<li data-start=3D"4989" data-end=3D"5142" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4991" data-end=3D"5142" class=3D"">Lorsque la valeur de <c=
ode data-start=3D"5012" data-end=3D"5022">imageUrl</code> dans le mod=C3=A8=
