<h3 data-start=3D"6198" data-end=3D"6225" class=3D"">3.4 Explication du Cod=
e</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6227" data-end=3D"6486">
<li data-start=3D"6227" data-end=3D"6290" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6229" data-end=3D"6290" class=3D"">La directive <code data=
-start=3D"6242" data-end=3D"6251">ngStyle</code> applique les styles CSS dy=
namiquement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6291" data-end=3D"6363" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6293" data-end=3D"6363" class=3D"">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 =
<code data-start=3D"6306" data-end=3D"6313">color</code> est li=C3=A9e =C3=
=A0 la variable <code data-start=3D"6337" data-end=3D"6344">color</code> da=
ns le composant.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6364" data-end=3D"6486" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6366" data-end=3D"6486" class=3D"">La propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9 =
<code data-start=3D"6379" data-end=3D"6390">font-size</code> est li=C3=A9e =
=C3=A0 la variable <code data-start=3D"6414" data-end=3D"6424">fontSize</co=
de>, qui est convertie en cha=C3=AEne de caract=C3=A8res avec l'unit=C3=A9 =
<code data-start=3D"6481" data-end=3D"6485">px</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
