<li data-start=3D"1425" data-end=3D"1593" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1428" data-end=3D"1593" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
428" data-end=3D"1462">Pipes int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9s (ou pr=C3=A9d=C3=A9finis)</=
strong> : Angular fournit un certain nombre de pipes pr=C3=AAts =C3=A0 l'em=
ploi, comme <code data-start=3D"1532" data-end=3D"1538">date</code>, <code =
data-start=3D"1540" data-end=3D"1551">uppercase</code>, <code data-start=3D=
"1553" data-end=3D"1564">lowercase</code>, <code data-start=3D"1566" data-e=
