<hr data-start=3D"4543" data-end=3D"4546" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4548" data-end=3D"4594" class=3D"">Partie 3 : La Gestion =
du Scope des Services</h2>
<p data-start=3D"4596" data-end=3D"4772" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"4599" data-end=3D"4608">scope</strong> d=E2=80=99un service d=C3=A9term=
ine sa dur=C3=A9e de vie et l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tendue de son accessibilit=C3=
=A9 au sein de l'application. Angular g=C3=A8re trois principaux types de s=
cope pour les services :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4774" data-end=3D"4858">
<li data-start=3D"4774" data-end=3D"4815" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4777" data-end=3D"4815" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
777" data-end=3D"4793">Scope Global</strong> (Application enti=C3=A8re)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4816" data-end=3D"4835" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4819" data-end=3D"4835" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
819" data-end=3D"4835">Scope Module</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4836" data-end=3D"4858" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4839" data-end=3D"4858" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
839" data-end=3D"4858">Scope Composant</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4860" data-end=3D"4917" class=3D"">3.1 Scope Global (Sing=
leton dans toute l=E2=80=99application)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4919" data-end=3D"5349" class=3D"">Lorsque vous d=C3=A9cla=
rez un service avec <code data-start=3D"4957" data-end=3D"4977">providedIn:=
 'root'</code>, Angular cr=C3=A9e une <strong data-start=3D"4996" data-end=
=3D"5014">seule instance</strong> du service, partag=C3=A9e entre tous les =
composants, services et modules de l'application. Ce mod=C3=A8le garantit q=
ue vous n'avez qu'une seule instance du service pendant toute la dur=C3=A9e=
 de vie de l'application, ce qui est souvent utile pour les services qui g=
=C3=A8rent des ressources partag=C3=A9es comme des connexions API ou des se=
ssions utilisateur.</p>
<p data-start=3D"5351" data-end=3D"5386" class=3D"">Exemple avec <code data=
-start=3D"5364" data-end=3D"5384">providedIn: 'root'</code> :</p>
<pre class=3D"!overflow-visible" data-start=3D"5388" data-end=3D"5493"><div=
