issant qu=E2=80=99il n=E2=80=99y a qu=E2=80=99une seule instance du service=
.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5660" data-end=3D"5684" class=3D"">3.2 Scope par Module</=
h3>
<p data-start=3D"5686" data-end=3D"5976" class=3D"">Si vous d=C3=A9clarez u=
