<p data-start=3D"6179" data-end=3D"6520" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"6182" data-end=3D"6197"><code data-start=3D"6184" data-end=3D"6195">For=
mArray</code></strong> est une collection de <code data-start=3D"6220" data=
