<hr data-start=3D"8614" data-end=3D"8617" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8619" data-end=3D"8665" class=3D"">=F0=9F=93=8C 6. Valida=
tion Dynamique dans <code data-start=3D"8654" data-end=3D"8665">FormArray</=
code></h2>
<p data-start=3D"8667" data-end=3D"8828" class=3D"">Les validations dans <c=
ode data-start=3D"8688" data-end=3D"8699">FormArray</code> peuvent =C3=AAtr=
e dynamiques. Vous pouvez ajouter des validations conditionnelles ou des r=
=C3=A8gles bas=C3=A9es sur l'entr=C3=A9e de l'utilisateur.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"8830" data-end=3D"8833" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8835" data-end=3D"8870" class=3D"">=F0=9F=93=8C 7. R=C3=
=A9sum=C3=A9 et Bonnes Pratiques</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"8872" data-end=3D"8918" class=3D"">=F0=9F=94=B9 7.1 Struc=
ture des Formulaires Complexes</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"8920" data-end=3D"9156">
<li data-start=3D"8920" data-end=3D"8972" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8922" data-end=3D"8972" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
922" data-end=3D"8937">FormControl</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9 pour des champs =
simples.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8973" data-end=3D"9052" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8975" data-end=3D"9052" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
975" data-end=3D"8988">FormGroup</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9 pour regrouper des=
 contr=C3=B4les logiques en un ensemble.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9053" data-end=3D"9156" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9055" data-end=3D"9156" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
055" data-end=3D"9068">FormArray</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9 pour g=C3=A9rer de=
s ensembles dynamiques de contr=C3=B4les (ex : une liste d'=C3=A9l=C3=A9men=
ts).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"9158" data-end=3D"9185" class=3D"">=F0=9F=94=B9 7.2 Bonne=
s Pratiques</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"9187" data-end=3D"9545">
<li data-start=3D"9187" data-end=3D"9306" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9189" data-end=3D"9306" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
189" data-end=3D"9203">Modularit=C3=A9</strong> : Utilisez des <strong data=
-start=3D"9219" data-end=3D"9232">FormGroup</strong> et <strong data-start=
=3D"9236" data-end=3D"9249">FormArray</strong> pour maintenir des formulair=
es organis=C3=A9s et modifiables.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9307" data-end=3D"9414" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9309" data-end=3D"9414" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
309" data-end=3D"9323">Validation</strong> : Ajoutez des validations de man=
i=C3=A8re dynamique =C3=A0 l'aide de m=C3=A9thodes comme <code data-start=
=3D"9398" data-end=3D"9413">setValidators</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9415" data-end=3D"9542" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9417" data-end=3D"9542" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
417" data-end=3D"9428">Erreurs</strong> : Utilisez des messages d=E2=80=99e=
rreur conditionnels bas=C3=A9s sur les =C3=A9tats du formulaire (<code data=
-start=3D"9511" data-end=3D"9520">invalid</code>, <code data-start=3D"9522"=
 data-end=3D"9531">touched</code>, <code data-start=3D"9533" data-end=3D"95=
40">dirty</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
