<h2 data-start=3D"3449" data-end=3D"3488" class=3D"">=F0=9F=93=8C 3. Compre=
ndre les Op=C3=A9rateurs RxJS</h2>
<p data-start=3D"3490" data-end=3D"3681" class=3D"">Les op=C3=A9rateurs RxJ=
S sont des fonctions puissantes permettant de transformer, filtrer, ou comb=
iner des flux de donn=C3=A9es. Ils sont g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement utilis=C3=A9=
s en cha=C3=AEne pour manipuler les Observables.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3683" data-end=3D"3712" class=3D"">=F0=9F=94=B9 3.1 Types=
 d'Op=C3=A9rateurs</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3714" data-end=3D"3806" class=3D"">RxJS dispose de plusieu=
rs types d'op=C3=A9rateurs, chacun ayant des fonctionnalit=C3=A9s sp=C3=A9c=
ifiques :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3808" data-end=3D"4280">
<li data-start=3D"3808" data-end=3D"3886" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3810" data-end=3D"3886" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
810" data-end=3D"3822">Cr=C3=A9ation</strong> : Permet de cr=C3=A9er des Ob=
servables. Exemples : <code data-start=3D"3869" data-end=3D"3875">of()</cod=
e>, <code data-start=3D"3877" data-end=3D"3885">from()</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3887" data-end=3D"3981" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3889" data-end=3D"3981" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
889" data-end=3D"3907">Transformation</strong> : Modifie ou transforme les =
donn=C3=A9es =C3=A9mises. Exemple : <code data-start=3D"3962" data-end=3D"3=
969">map()</code>, <code data-start=3D"3971" data-end=3D"3980">pluck()</cod=
e>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3982" data-end=3D"4086" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3984" data-end=3D"4086" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
984" data-end=3D"3996">Filtrage</strong> : Permet de filtrer les valeurs =
=C3=A9mises par un Observable. Exemple : <code data-start=3D"4065" data-end=
=3D"4075">filter()</code>, <code data-start=3D"4077" data-end=3D"4085">take=
()</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4087" data-end=3D"4181" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4089" data-end=3D"4181" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
089" data-end=3D"4104">Combinaison</strong> : Combine plusieurs Observables=
 en un seul. Exemple : <code data-start=3D"4159" data-end=3D"4168">merge()<=
/code>, <code data-start=3D"4170" data-end=3D"4180">concat()</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4182" data-end=3D"4280" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4184" data-end=3D"4280" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
184" data-end=3D"4207">Gestion des erreurs</strong> : G=C3=A8re les erreurs=
 d=E2=80=99un Observable. Exemple : <code data-start=3D"4254" data-end=3D"4=
268">catchError()</code>, <code data-start=3D"4270" data-end=3D"4279">retry=
()</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
