<p data-start=3D"3856" data-end=3D"3869" class=3D"">Explication :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3870" data-end=3D"4140">
<li data-start=3D"3870" data-end=3D"4003" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3872" data-end=3D"4003" class=3D"">Lorsque <code data-star=
t=3D"3880" data-end=3D"3894">Subscriber 1</code> s'abonne, il re=C3=A7oit d=
'abord la valeur initiale (<code data-start=3D"3943" data-end=3D"3960">'Ini=
tial Value'</code>), puis la nouvelle valeur (<code data-start=3D"3988" dat=
a-end=3D"4001">'New Value'</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4004" data-end=3D"4140" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4006" data-end=3D"4140" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"400=
6" data-end=3D"4020">Subscriber 2</code>, qui s'abonne apr=C3=A8s l'=C3=A9m=
ission de <code data-start=3D"4055" data-end=3D"4068">'New Value'</code>, r=
e=C3=A7oit imm=C3=A9diatement la derni=C3=A8re valeur =C3=A9mise, =C3=A0 sa=
voir <code data-start=3D"4126" data-end=3D"4139">'New Value'</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4142" data-end=3D"4314" class=3D"">Le <code data-start=3D"=
4145" data-end=3D"4162">BehaviorSubject</code> conserve toujours la derni=
=C3=A8re valeur =C3=A9mise et la rediffuse aux nouveaux abonn=C3=A9s, ce qu=
i le rend tr=C3=A8s utile pour les applications ayant un =C3=A9tat partag=
=C3=A9.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4316" data-end=3D"4319" class=3D"">
