s donn=C3=A9es de la r=C3=A9ponse.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1173" data-end=3D"1225" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1175" data-end=3D"1225" class=3D"">G=C3=A9rer les erreurs =
globales de mani=C3=A8re centralis=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1226" data-end=3D"1333" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1228" data-end=3D"1333" class=3D"">Enregistrer les perform=
ances des requ=C3=AAtes HTTP (par exemple, mesurer le temps d'ex=C3=A9cutio=
n d'une requ=C3=AAte).</p>
</li>
</ul>
