<hr data-start=3D"6115" data-end=3D"6118" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6120" data-end=3D"6180" class=3D"">=F0=9F=93=8C 4. Introd=
uction =C3=A0 Akita (State Management Alternative)</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6182" data-end=3D"6460" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
182" data-end=3D"6191">Akita</strong> est une autre biblioth=C3=A8que de ge=
stion de l'=C3=A9tat pour Angular, qui simplifie la gestion des donn=C3=A9e=
s sans n=C3=A9cessiter autant de boilerplate que NgRx. Akita fournit des st=
