<li data-start=3D"9185" data-end=3D"9255" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9187" data-end=3D"9255" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
187" data-end=3D"9199">Reducers</strong> : Met =C3=A0 jour l'=C3=A9tat des =
t=C3=A2ches en fonction des actions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9256" data-end=3D"9335" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9258" data-end=3D"9335" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"9=
