cod=C3=A9es.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3375" data-end=3D"3378" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3380" data-end=3D"3409" class=3D"">2. Pourquoi utiliser J=
WT ?</h2>
<p data-start=3D"3411" data-end=3D"3514" class=3D"">Voici quelques raisons =
pour lesquelles vous devriez envisager d'utiliser JWT dans une application =
web :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3516" data-end=3D"4180">
<li data-start=3D"3516" data-end=3D"3664" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3518" data-end=3D"3664" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
518" data-end=3D"3531">Stateless</strong> : Le serveur n'a pas besoin de ma=
intenir de session c=C3=B4t=C3=A9 serveur, car toutes les informations n=C3=
=A9cessaires sont stock=C3=A9es dans le JWT.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3665" data-end=3D"3848" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3667" data-end=3D"3848" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
667" data-end=3D"3679">S=C3=A9curis=C3=A9</strong> : La signature du JWT ga=
rantit que les donn=C3=A9es n'ont pas =C3=A9t=C3=A9 modifi=C3=A9es, et l'ut=
ilisation d'un algorithme de signature fort prot=C3=A8ge contre les attaque=
s de falsification.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3849" data-end=3D"4020" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3851" data-end=3D"4020" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
851" data-end=3D"3863">Flexible</strong> : Il peut contenir n'importe quell=
e information dans le payload, ce qui le rend adaptable =C3=A0 divers cas d=
'utilisation (authentification, autorisation, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4021" data-end=3D"4180" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4023" data-end=3D"4180" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
023" data-end=3D"4072">Facilit=C3=A9 d'int=C3=A9gration avec les microservi=
ces</strong> : En =C3=A9tant ind=C3=A9pendant du backend, il facilite l'aut=
hentification entre plusieurs services ou applications.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4182" data-end=3D"4185" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4187" data-end=3D"4211" class=3D"">3. Structure d'un JWT<=
/h2>
<p data-start=3D"4213" data-end=3D"4264" class=3D"">La structure d'un JWT s=
e compose de trois parties :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4265" data-end=3D"5417">
<li data-start=3D"4265" data-end=3D"4563" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4268" data-end=3D"4331" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
268" data-end=3D"4278">Header</strong> : C'est un objet JSON qui contient d=
eux propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4335" data-end=3D"4483">
<li data-start=3D"4335" data-end=3D"4420" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4337" data-end=3D"4420" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"433=
7" data-end=3D"4342">alg</code> : L'algorithme utilis=C3=A9 pour signer le =
JWT, comme <code data-start=3D"4392" data-end=3D"4399">HS256</code> (HMAC a=
vec SHA-256).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4424" data-end=3D"4479" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4426" data-end=3D"4479" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"442=
6" data-end=3D"4431">typ</code> : Le type du token, qui est g=C3=A9n=C3=A9r=
alement "JWT".</p>
</li>
</ul>
