<hr data-start=3D"5419" data-end=3D"5422" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5424" data-end=3D"5462" class=3D"">4. Flot d'authentifica=
tion avec JWT</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5464" data-end=3D"5526" class=3D"">L'authentification avec=
 JWT suit un flot en plusieurs =C3=A9tapes :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"5528" data-end=3D"6079">
<li data-start=3D"5528" data-end=3D"5634" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5531" data-end=3D"5634" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
531" data-end=3D"5560">L'utilisateur se connecte</strong> via un formulaire=
 d'authentification (nom d'utilisateur et mot de passe).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5635" data-end=3D"5704" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5638" data-end=3D"5704" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
638" data-end=3D"5676">Le backend valide les informations</strong> et g=C3=
=A9n=C3=A8re un <strong data-start=3D"5690" data-end=3D"5697">JWT</strong> =
sign=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5705" data-end=3D"5770" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5708" data-end=3D"5770" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
708" data-end=3D"5736">Le token JWT est renvoy=C3=A9</strong> au client (pa=
r exemple, Angular).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5771" data-end=3D"5856" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5774" data-end=3D"5856" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
774" data-end=3D"5805">Le client enregistre le JWT</strong> (souvent dans <=
code data-start=3D"5820" data-end=3D"5834">localStorage</code> ou <code dat=
a-start=3D"5838" data-end=3D"5854">sessionStorage</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5857" data-end=3D"5954" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5860" data-end=3D"5954" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
860" data-end=3D"5904">Le client envoie le token dans l'en-t=C3=AAte</stron=
g> de chaque requ=C3=AAte HTTP pour prouver son identit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5955" data-end=3D"6013" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5958" data-end=3D"6013" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
958" data-end=3D"5986">Le backend valide le JWT</strong> =C3=A0 chaque requ=
=C3=AAte prot=C3=A9g=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6014" data-end=3D"6079" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6017" data-end=3D"6079" class=3D"">Si le JWT est valide, l=
e backend envoie une r=C3=A9ponse autoris=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"6081" data-end=3D"6084" class=3D"">
