<h2 data-start=3D"4363" data-end=3D"4407" class=3D"">3. Stockage de Session=
 (<code data-start=3D"4390" data-end=3D"4406">sessionStorage</code>)</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4409" data-end=3D"4430" class=3D"">3.1. Introduction</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4432" data-end=3D"4847" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"443=
2" data-end=3D"4448">sessionStorage</code> fonctionne de mani=C3=A8re simil=
aire =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"4483" data-end=3D"4497">localStorage</code>=
, mais avec une dur=C3=A9e de vie plus courte : les donn=C3=A9es stock=C3=
=A9es sont conserv=C3=A9es seulement pour la dur=C3=A9e de la session de na=
vigation (c'est-=C3=A0-dire jusqu'=C3=A0 la fermeture de l'onglet ou du nav=
igateur). Contrairement =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"4711" data-end=3D"4725">=
localStorage</code>, <code data-start=3D"4727" data-end=3D"4743">sessionSto=
rage</code> n'est pas partag=C3=A9 entre les fen=C3=AAtres ou onglets ouver=
ts. Chaque onglet a son propre espace de stockage.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4849" data-end=3D"4878" class=3D"">3.2. M=C3=A9thodes dis=
ponibles</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4880" data-end=3D"4971" class=3D"">Les m=C3=A9thodes dispo=
nibles pour <code data-start=3D"4910" data-end=3D"4926">sessionStorage</cod=
e> sont identiques =C3=A0 celles de <code data-start=3D"4955" data-end=3D"4=
969">localStorage</code> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4973" data-end=3D"5437">
<li data-start=3D"4973" data-end=3D"5069" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4975" data-end=3D"5069" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
975" data-end=3D"5015"><code data-start=3D"4977" data-end=3D"5013">sessionS=
torage.setItem(key, value)</code></strong> : Permet de stocker une donn=C3=
=A9e dans <code data-start=3D"5052" data-end=3D"5068">sessionStorage</code>=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5070" data-end=3D"5159" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5072" data-end=3D"5159" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
072" data-end=3D"5105"><code data-start=3D"5074" data-end=3D"5103">sessionS=
torage.getItem(key)</code></strong> : Permet de r=C3=A9cup=C3=A9rer une don=
n=C3=A9e de <code data-start=3D"5142" data-end=3D"5158">sessionStorage</cod=
e>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5160" data-end=3D"5252" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5162" data-end=3D"5252" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
162" data-end=3D"5198"><code data-start=3D"5164" data-end=3D"5196">sessionS=
torage.removeItem(key)</code></strong> : Permet de supprimer une donn=C3=A9=
e de <code data-start=3D"5235" data-end=3D"5251">sessionStorage</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5253" data-end=3D"5341" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5255" data-end=3D"5341" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
255" data-end=3D"5283"><code data-start=3D"5257" data-end=3D"5281">sessionS=
torage.clear()</code></strong> : Permet de vider toutes les donn=C3=A9es de=
 <code data-start=3D"5324" data-end=3D"5340">sessionStorage</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5342" data-end=3D"5437" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5344" data-end=3D"5437" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
344" data-end=3D"5371"><code data-start=3D"5346" data-end=3D"5369">sessionS=
torage.length</code></strong> : Permet de conna=C3=AEtre le nombre d'=C3=A9=
l=C3=A9ments dans <code data-start=3D"5420" data-end=3D"5436">sessionStorag=
e</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
