<h3 data-start=3D"3824" data-end=3D"3870" class=3D"">3.2. Cr=C3=A9ation de =
Modules pour Lazy Loading</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3872" data-end=3D"4131" class=3D"">Dans une application An=
