<h2 data-start=3D"9306" data-end=3D"9355" class=3D"">6. Avantages et Inconv=
=C3=A9nients du Pr=C3=A9chargement</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"9357" data-end=3D"9370" class=3D"">Avantages</h3>
