<li data-start=3D"2295" data-end=3D"2337" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2297" data-end=3D"2337" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"2300" data-end=3D"2336">allongement des temps de r=C3=A9ponse</strong>.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2338" data-end=3D"2407" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2340" data-end=3D"2407" class=3D"">Une <strong data-start=
=3D"2344" data-end=3D"2390">augmentation de la consommation de m=C3=A9moire=
</strong> au fil du temps.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2408" data-end=3D"2463" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2410" data-end=3D"2463" class=3D"">Une <strong data-start=
=3D"2414" data-end=3D"2445">diminution de la r=C3=A9activit=C3=A9</strong> =
de l'application.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2465" data-end=3D"2468" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2470" data-end=3D"2527" class=3D"">2. Causes Courantes de=
s Fuites de M=C3=A9moire dans Angular</h2>
