<h3 data-start=3D"6638" data-end=3D"6666" class=3D"">=C3=89tape 3 : Service=
 Worker</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6668" data-end=3D"6892" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"6671" data-end=3D"6689">Service Worker</strong> est un fichier JavaScri=
