=A0 un service worker de base via <code data-start=3D"6800" data-end=3D"682=
5">@angular/service-worker</code>, mais vous pouvez personnaliser la logiqu=
e du cache si n=C3=A9cessaire.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6894" data-end=3D"6897" class=3D"">
