<h3 data-start=3D"3952" data-end=3D"3984" class=3D"">Explication des propri=
=C3=A9t=C3=A9s :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3986" data-end=3D"4717">
<li data-start=3D"3986" data-end=3D"4037" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3988" data-end=3D"4037" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
988" data-end=3D"3998"><code data-start=3D"3990" data-end=3D"3996">name</co=
de></strong> : Le nom complet de votre application.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4038" data-end=3D"4108" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4040" data-end=3D"4108" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
040" data-end=3D"4056"><code data-start=3D"4042" data-end=3D"4054">short_na=
me</code></strong> : Le nom court utilis=C3=A9 lorsque l'espace est limit=
=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4109" data-end=3D"4170" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4111" data-end=3D"4170" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
111" data-end=3D"4128"><code data-start=3D"4113" data-end=3D"4126">descript=
ion</code></strong> : Une br=C3=A8ve description de l'application.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4171" data-end=3D"4269" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4173" data-end=3D"4269" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
173" data-end=3D"4188"><code data-start=3D"4175" data-end=3D"4186">start_ur=
l</code></strong> : L'URL =C3=A0 ouvrir lorsque l'application est lanc=C3=
=A9e =C3=A0 partir de l'=C3=A9cran d'accueil.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4270" data-end=3D"4410" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4272" data-end=3D"4410" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
272" data-end=3D"4285"><code data-start=3D"4274" data-end=3D"4283">display<=
/code></strong> : Le mode d'affichage. <code data-start=3D"4309" data-end=
=3D"4321">standalone</code> permet =C3=A0 l'application de s'ex=C3=A9cuter =
en plein =C3=A9cran, sans barre d'adresse du navigateur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4411" data-end=3D"4490" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4413" data-end=3D"4490" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
413" data-end=3D"4435"><code data-start=3D"4415" data-end=3D"4433">backgrou=
nd_color</code></strong> : La couleur de fond lorsque l'application est lan=
c=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4491" data-end=3D"4583" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4493" data-end=3D"4583" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
493" data-end=3D"4510"><code data-start=3D"4495" data-end=3D"4508">theme_co=
lor</code></strong> : La couleur utilis=C3=A9e pour la barre d'adresse sur =
les appareils Android.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4584" data-end=3D"4717" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4586" data-end=3D"4717" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
586" data-end=3D"4597"><code data-start=3D"4588" data-end=3D"4595">icons</c=
ode></strong> : Les ic=C3=B4nes =C3=A0 afficher sur l'=C3=A9cran d'accueil.=
 Vous devez vous assurer que vous avez des ic=C3=B4nes de diff=C3=A9rentes =
tailles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4719" data-end=3D"4722" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4724" data-end=3D"4758" class=3D"">5. Configurer le Servi=
ce Worker</h2>
<p data-start=3D"4760" data-end=3D"4982" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"4763" data-end=3D"4781">Service Worker</strong> est l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment=
 cl=C3=A9 qui permet =C3=A0 votre PWA de fonctionner hors ligne et d'=C3=AA=
tre rapide m=C3=AAme avec des connexions faibles. Il s'ex=C3=A9cute en arri=
=C3=A8re-plan et g=C3=A8re le cache des ressources de votre application.</p=
>
<p data-start=3D"4984" data-end=3D"5084" class=3D"">Angular g=C3=A9n=C3=A8r=
e un Service Worker de base pour vous, mais vous pouvez personnaliser son c=
omportement.</p>
