<h3 data-start=3D"5588" data-end=3D"5605" class=3D"">Explication :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5607" data-end=3D"6045">
<li data-start=3D"5607" data-end=3D"5741" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5609" data-end=3D"5741" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
609" data-end=3D"5624">assetGroups</strong> : Ce groupe contient les ressou=
rces essentielles qui doivent =C3=AAtre mises en cache (comme <code data-st=
art=3D"5713" data-end=3D"5725">index.html</code>, <code data-start=3D"5727"=
 data-end=3D"5739">styles.css</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5742" data-end=3D"5892" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5744" data-end=3D"5892" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
744" data-end=3D"5758">dataGroups</strong> : Ce groupe concerne les API. Pa=
r exemple, vous pouvez mettre en cache les r=C3=A9ponses des API externes p=
our une utilisation hors ligne.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5893" data-end=3D"6045" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5895" data-end=3D"6045" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
895" data-end=3D"5910">cacheConfig</strong> : Vous pouvez d=C3=A9finir des =
